  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4602.79 “Unsold allowance” means a CO2 budget allowance that has been made available for sale in an auction conducted under Env-A 4800 but not sold.\n\nSource. #10468, eff 1-1-14 14 (from Env-A 4602.75); ss by #12967, eff 1-1-20 (from Env-A 4602.80)",
